{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｸﾞﾙｸﾞﾙ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗ  ..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ﾊﾟｶｯ   !!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｼﾞｬｼﾞｬｰﾝ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "∧＿∧           ╭◜◝   ◜◝   ◜◝ ╮\n‎꒰ ˶ ɞ̴̶̷ ༝ ɞ̴̶̷ ˶꒱ .oO  君に揺らされて\n‎  /づ~‎◝🧚🏻‍♀️       ╰◟◞   ◟◞   ◟◞ ╯"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神奈川県出身 21歳\n日向坂46  五期生のまつおさくらです。\nブログを開いて下さり本当に本当にありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日夢のような体験が。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆にとって夢のような体験って？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うんうんそうなんだ\nどんな体験があってもいいよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は夢のような体験をしに行く朝\n大好きな音楽を聴きまくっていて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前からマルシィさんとか、This is LASTさんとかの毎回違う出演者さんが出てるMVを色々観るのが好きで、\n特に「ただそれだけの事がさ」に出てる久間田琳加さんとか、「絵空」の今村優花さんの彼女感が可愛すぎて可愛いの。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もいつか日向坂46以外のMVに出ることもひとつの夢。実はね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなことを思いながら家を出発して、\n夢にたどり着いたんだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは現実です⟡.·⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "妄想も楽しいし夢も楽しいけど\n結局現実には敵わないよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mob8P4Gtz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobIEDUrz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小西さんが撮る松尾さんは\nいつもより肌のハリがあるように見える！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobFVbM5x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobqfH1Mn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日お仕事で隣に小西さんがいる時に\n虹を見れて、\n思わずやったーって声に出しちゃった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんな経験中々ないもんね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから一秒一秒大切にしてこって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小西さんは色んな意見を聞いてくださるし、これはこうだから似合うとか色々カチューシャも選んでくださるし、優しいの塊なんだ〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobb0ZqkF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobEEF5PR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よく見たらカチューシャ逆泣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "25周年だったよ\n君の人生の25周年目はどんな歳だった？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もまだ体験してないけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと\n素敵な歳になっているだろうな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "予想します"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "多分海外で、野生のペンギン見に行ってる。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うんそうなんだ\nどんな25歳があってもいいよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "意地でも未来を信じましょう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobSE4IfY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobu0V3ih.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おおたさんは一緒に遊ぶといつも色んなことを調べてくれて、すごくしっかりしているし、リードしてくれるんだよ\n頼りになるんだとても"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから色んな場所に旅行行きたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はピーターパンが好きだな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【人生無敵モード】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なれるもんならなりたい！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けど無敵モードに入ったらきっと周りは何も見れなくなるんだろうな\nそれくらいならこのままで頑張ろう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなも一緒に頑張ろう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういえばおーのさんが\nMs.トクニナルドになってたよ\nTVCMが発表されました🍔🥤\nおめでとう！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ皆さんもチェックしてください！\nそしてマクドナルドで会いましょう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たち五期生が日向坂46に応募してから約2年が立とうとしてますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五期生は10人だし、いろんな素敵な10人が集まった期です！それぞれが好きなことで個性が引き出せるように、そしてそれぞれの魅力がたくさんの方々に伝わるように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もっともっとまだ知られていないような事が眠っているよ、一人一人の魅力が輝いて伝わりますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなの魅力にも目を向けてみてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか\nみんなの夢をかなえて、ドラえもん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎週金曜11:30~\nお昼前に私たちが癒しをお届けします！！\n日向坂46のほっとひといき！こちらもぜひ聴いてください\n🔗https://radiko.jp/podcast/channels/c6ef1c75-a12c-41f2-9d30-e358de94438a"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日はかほさんとのペアです！！\n20歳を迎えたかほさんのほっとひといき！ぜひお聴き下さい💙🩷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それではまたね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事、生活、学校、色々あった方は、お疲れ様！また明日も一緒に頑張ろうねー！\nこれからお仕事や予定がある方も一緒に頑張ろー！🌟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が頑張れー！！！\nってずーっと応援しているよ\nあなたの頑張りは桜が見ているからね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日も素敵な一日になりますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読んでくれて本当にありがとう！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日も元気にさくラブリー ( ̳- ·̫ - ̳ˆ )◞❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#sakulovelog"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "93さく"}], "source": "official"}